---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="repo" number="05" label="Your repo" title="Markdown in your repo.">
  <p class="sub">
    The backlog lives in <code>.dispatch/</code>, next to the code it describes.
  </p>
  <dl class="notes">
    <div>
      <dt>Two-way Linear sync</dt>
      <dd>Your tracker stays current. Replace Linear, or keep it and sync.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Local by default</dt>
      <dd>Your code goes nowhere. Opt into team sharing when you want it.</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</Section>

<style>
  .notes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .notes div {
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--surface-card);
  }
  dt {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  dd {
    margin: var(--space-1) 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .notes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
